                    'EARNINGS. THAT EXCLUDES AT LEAST FOUR OF THE TEN NAMES ON THIS SLIDE. || 📌 THE ORDER THIS BOARD '
                    'USES AND WILL KEEP USING: FIRST, DOES IT MAKE MONEY UNDER GAAP. SECOND, DOES THE CASH AGREE WITH '
